'''The Watcher''' is the {{mcat|b}} in the [[Blood Room]] of [[The Catacombs]]. In the [[The Catacombs - Entrance|Entrance]] floor, defeating them completes the run, but in all other floors, defeating them opens a portal to the main {{MobCategory|b}} of that floor. 

== The Fight ==
=== Overview ===
When the [[Blood Room]] is first opened, '''The Watcher''' will say some dialogue, and then start spawning various [[#Summoned Mobs|Mobs]]. The amount spawned increases with higher floors, starting at {{Green|9}} in [[Entrance]] and increasing by {{Green|1}} with each floor.<ref>
{{Cite Discord
|staff=yes
|url=https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1557142756562837517
|user=mrkeith
|text=
<pre>another dungeons related question, how many watcher undeads get spawned from the watcher?</pre>

{{Code|9 + (floorTier)}} it appears, code is quite branching}}
</ref> These include multiple {{MobSprite|Undead (Watcher);Undead}}s, as well as various {{MobCategory|mb}} mobs in higher floors. These mobs first appear as heads in display cases on the walls, which the Watcher flies to when picking to spawn.

The Watcher cannot be damaged, and trying to do so will cause him to attack back with a laser. In [[The Catacombs - Floor IV|Floor IV]] and above, he also has {{MobSprite|Watchful Eye|nolink=yes}}s to prevent players from going more than several blocks up in the arena.

Players who are dead when the fight starts or die during the fight are reanimated as a hostile {{MobSprite|Wandering Soul}} that resembles the player who died. Killing a Wandering Soul will revive the player it resembles. 

Once all of [[#Summoned Mobs|Mobs]] are summoned and killed, in the [[The Catacombs - Entrance|Entrance]] floor, the run completes. In all other floors, a portal will open to the main {{MobCategory|b}} of that floor, and 1-2 {{Item|Dungeon Blessing|text=Blessings of Time V}} and a {{Item|Dungeon Blessing|text=Blessing of Power V}} will spawn. There is also a {{Chance|1.23%|1|81.3|rolls}} chance for an {{Item|Optical Lens}} to drop.

=== Arena ===
<gallery type="slideshow" widths="200px">
Blood Room (Floor 1).png|[[The Catacombs - Floor I]].
Blood Room (Entrance).png|[[The Catacombs - Entrance]].
</gallery>

The Watcher's arena is fairly simple. There are 4 chains in the room with the Undead's and Player's heads on the wall. There are some corridors behind the Undead wall. A way to cheese the boss up to  [[The Catacombs - Floor III|Floor III]] is to go on top of the portal, entrance door, or go on the second layer of the Undead. Keep in mind the top of the exit portal changes on every floor to represent the boss of that floor.

