Higher [[Catacombs#Floors|Floors]] have changes to the Watcher's behavior:
* Starting from [[The Catacombs - Floor II|Floor II]], the Undead gain special perks according to their type.
* Starting from [[The Catacombs - Floor III|Floor III]], {{MobSprite|Bonzo (Watcher);Bonzo}} can appear reanimated at the start of the fight. The reanimated Bonzo can perform his fireworks ability when brought down below {{Stat|Health|50%}}.
* Starting from [[The Catacombs - Floor IV|Floor IV]], the Watcher will be next to 2 Watchful Eyes, which deals {{Red|25%}} of the player's {{Stat|Health}} as {{Stat|True Damage}} every second the player is too high up in the arena. Additionally, {{MobSprite|Scarf (Watcher);Scarf}} can appear at the start instead of {{MobSprite|Bonzo (Watcher);Bonzo}}.
* Starting from [[The Catacombs - Floor V|Floor V]], all mobs spawned gain a random modifier. In just this floor, the modifier will be announced as dialogue before the fight begins. The {{MobSprite|Spirit Bear (Watcher);Spirit Bear}} also can now spawn instead of {{MobSprite|Bonzo (Watcher);Bonzo}} or {{MobSprite|Scarf (Watcher);Scarf}}.

