* Starting from [[The Catacombs - Floor VI|Floor VI]], The Watcher no longer announces the modifier of its summons before starting. Additionally, {{MobSprite|Livid (Watcher);Livid}} can appear instead of {{MobSprite|Bonzo (Watcher);Bonzo}}, {{MobSprite|Scarf (Watcher);Scarf}}, or a {{MobSprite|Spirit Bear (Watcher);Spirit Bear}}, dropping a {{Item|Livid Fragment}}. Additionally, {{MobSprite|Bonzo (Watcher);Bonzo}} or {{MobSprite|Scarf (Watcher);Scarf}} can now drop their own respective fragment items.
* In [[The Catacombs - Floor VII|Floor VII]], before any other spawns, one of {{MobSprite|Sadan}}'s giants ({{MobSprite|Bigfoot (Watcher);Bigfoot}}, {{MobSprite|Jolly Pink Giant (Watcher);Jolly Pink Giant}}, {{MobSprite|L.A.S.R. (Watcher);L.A.S.R.}}, {{MobSprite|The Diamond Giant (Watcher);The Diamond Giant}}) will be reanimated. The pillars will be removed in the arena, making space for the Giant, although there's a rare chance the pillars won't be removed. Each one has a chance to drop its respective [[Precursor Relic]], which can upgrade [[Wither Armor]] dropped from [[Necron]].

=== Summoned Mobs ===
The Watcher will spawn multiple {{MobSprite|Undead (Watcher);Undead}} mobs with various names and appearances. These include {{MobSprite|Mr. Dead|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Revoker|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Tear|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Skull|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Walker|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Cannibal|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Frost|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Putrid|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Reaper|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Vader|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Flamer|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Freak|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Leech|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Mute|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Ooze|nolink=yes}}, {{MobSprite|Parasite|nolink=yes}}, and {{MobSprite|Psycho|nolink=yes}}. They can also appear as {{MobSprite|Wandering Soul|nolink=yes}}s.

Additionally, starting from [[The Catacombs - Floor III]], different reincarnations of previous {{MobCategory|boss}} mobs will start spawning. In [[The Catacombs - Floor VII]], a random giant from the {{MobSprite|Sadan}} fight will also spawn.

